WEBVTT

01:49.390 --> 01:54.979
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.009 --> 01:57.920
[Episode 3]

01:58.039 --> 01:58.840
Jia Ruru,

01:58.920 --> 01:59.840
are you really not

01:59.840 --> 02:01.510
going to lock me up in a room

02:01.510 --> 02:02.780
and beat me up?

02:18.240 --> 02:19.350
What's going on?

02:19.390 --> 02:20.720
Why aren't they moving?

02:26.920 --> 02:30.740
Help! The script is killing me!

02:32.210 --> 02:33.870
Miss Song fell into the water!

02:39.880 --> 02:41.320
Seriously?

02:42.060 --> 02:43.640
Taking my life again?

02:44.000 --> 02:45.960
I've died so many times.

02:52.410 --> 02:53.480
Nan Heng?

02:53.710 --> 02:55.510
He looks exactly like Nan Feng.

02:56.070 --> 02:57.610
The same smug look.

02:58.190 --> 02:59.270
The same...

03:04.470 --> 03:06.070
I'd rather be dead.

03:06.150 --> 03:08.000
I'd sooner be drowned

03:08.000 --> 03:09.940
than go through the plots with you.

03:22.640 --> 03:24.020
It was His Highness's decision to jump?

03:24.020 --> 03:25.110
Are you sure?

03:28.360 --> 03:29.430
It is so

03:29.430 --> 03:31.710
wise of His Highness.

03:31.960 --> 03:33.150
How brilliant.

03:33.310 --> 03:34.120
Yiting!

03:34.160 --> 03:35.160
Yiting!

03:35.470 --> 03:36.520
I heard someone fell into the water.

03:36.520 --> 03:37.760
Are you okay?

03:37.840 --> 03:39.890
I'm standing right here.
Of course I'm fine.

03:39.890 --> 03:41.630
It was my sister who fell into the water,

03:41.630 --> 03:42.800
followed by the Seventh Prince.

03:42.800 --> 03:43.710
Heng?

03:43.870 --> 03:44.910
No way!

03:45.310 --> 03:46.590
Did it really happen?

03:53.680 --> 03:54.780
This is bad.

03:54.800 --> 03:56.120
Here comes the iconic scene.

03:56.040 --> 04:01.760
[A Dream of Qingning]
[Scene 4, Episode 3]

04:12.240 --> 04:13.370
Thank Your Highness

04:13.680 --> 04:15.080
for saving my life.

04:15.080 --> 04:16.649
Well, I need to be somewhere else.

04:16.649 --> 04:17.670
I have to go now.

04:17.959 --> 04:18.950
Song Yimeng,

04:19.120 --> 04:20.120
I know

04:20.190 --> 04:21.510
you deliberately fell into the water

04:21.510 --> 04:23.170
to seduce the Seventh Prince!

04:24.750 --> 04:26.040
I don't know what you're saying.

04:26.040 --> 04:26.430
Let me go.

04:26.430 --> 04:27.430
You want to leave?

04:28.070 --> 04:29.040
Now you're scared, huh?

04:29.040 --> 04:30.720
Remember what you just told me?

04:30.720 --> 04:32.040
"Chu Guihong wants to marry me."

04:32.040 --> 04:33.500
"So does the Seventh P..."

04:34.720 --> 04:35.640
Yimeng,

04:35.659 --> 04:37.230
what is this about?

04:41.360 --> 04:42.210
How am I supposed

04:42.210 --> 04:43.330
have the answer?

04:49.920 --> 04:51.900
He's still putting on an act.

04:51.950 --> 04:53.290
Fine.

04:53.390 --> 04:54.680
I'll take a risk then.

04:54.680 --> 04:56.340
This story line must end here.

04:59.140 --> 05:00.200
What are you doing?

05:02.180 --> 05:03.740
I just saved your life.

05:05.630 --> 05:06.800
You saved my life?

05:07.310 --> 05:08.950
Your Highness are approaching me

05:08.950 --> 05:10.630
for a purpose, aren't you?

05:12.360 --> 05:13.160
What?

05:13.560 --> 05:14.720
It's true, isn't it?

05:15.600 --> 05:16.310
You're aiming

05:16.310 --> 05:18.560
for my family's power, aren't you?

05:18.680 --> 05:20.640
Do you really think I'm ignorant?

05:20.870 --> 05:21.760
Well said!

05:22.070 --> 05:24.160
The Song sisters are unexpectedly

05:24.160 --> 05:26.680
perceptive.

05:28.270 --> 05:29.760
You mean I should

05:30.160 --> 05:31.750
have just let you drown,

05:31.770 --> 05:32.580
right?

05:32.750 --> 05:33.560
Right.

05:33.820 --> 05:35.659
A famous person once said,

05:35.730 --> 05:37.430
"Do not try to help others.

05:37.430 --> 05:39.070
Let their fate take its course."

05:39.070 --> 05:39.920
Do you get it?

05:41.050 --> 05:41.840
Okay.

05:42.630 --> 05:44.430
When you're in danger next time,

05:45.070 --> 05:47.120
I'll definitely not interfere.

05:47.470 --> 05:48.750
There won't be a next time.

05:48.750 --> 05:50.040
Your Highness and I

05:50.040 --> 05:52.430
had better go our separate ways

05:52.430 --> 05:53.600
and never see each other again.

05:53.600 --> 05:54.600
Farewell!

05:58.159 --> 05:59.330
Again?

06:00.000 --> 06:02.060
Your Highness, what should we do now?

06:09.510 --> 06:11.000
Wait. You...

06:17.160 --> 06:18.330
Your Highness,

06:19.070 --> 06:20.300
was it you

06:20.930 --> 06:22.850
who saved my life?

06:25.040 --> 06:25.830
I...

06:26.560 --> 06:28.300
Gosh. What are you doing?

06:34.659 --> 06:35.770
Your Highness,

06:36.680 --> 06:37.980
I don't have

06:38.130 --> 06:39.480
much to offer.

06:40.390 --> 06:41.510
In order to

06:42.010 --> 06:44.130
repay your kindness,

06:45.560 --> 06:46.920
I'd like to marry you.

06:48.920 --> 06:49.430
I...

06:54.340 --> 06:55.340
Cut it out!

07:28.310 --> 07:29.550
Overcranking?

07:29.570 --> 07:30.840
Spotlights?

07:31.080 --> 07:32.580
Arc shots?

07:33.360 --> 07:35.200
Stupid scriptwriter,

07:35.240 --> 07:36.930
I hate you!

07:37.990 --> 07:39.200
What is going on?

07:39.600 --> 07:41.450
Why can't I control my body?

07:42.060 --> 07:49.159
♪ Look at the sky, flowers bloom
and fragrance fills the air ♪

07:50.240 --> 07:56.970
♪ The sound of heartbeats
resonates in the passing time ♪

07:57.930 --> 08:04.910
♪ Look at the way you're going,
destiny has it all planned out ♪

08:03.480 --> 08:05.540
His Highness seems to be enjoying it.

08:05.600 --> 08:07.730
Is this part of his plan?

08:05.840 --> 08:16.500
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

08:12.510 --> 08:14.910
The Seventh Prince
has lost his first kiss.

08:27.560 --> 08:28.760
She got control of me.

08:29.070 --> 08:29.800
Fugui,

08:29.800 --> 08:31.190
take this vixen away!

08:31.240 --> 08:32.030
Bah!

08:32.620 --> 08:34.429
I'm the one being taken advantage of.

08:34.429 --> 08:35.870
Your Highness seem distraught.

08:35.870 --> 08:37.270
Was that your first kiss?

08:37.270 --> 08:38.030
I...

08:38.150 --> 08:39.909
That was Heng's first kiss?

08:39.909 --> 08:40.820
Is it true?

08:41.010 --> 08:42.390
So the God of Death is
in fact an innocent boy.

08:42.390 --> 08:44.030
How unbelievable. Someone at your age

08:44.030 --> 08:44.600
should...

08:44.600 --> 08:46.340
Get a move on! Shut up!

08:46.480 --> 08:48.480
His Highness is a real Casanova!

08:57.520 --> 08:58.550
Have you heard?

08:58.670 --> 09:00.510
The Seventh Prince just
lost his first kiss.

09:00.510 --> 09:01.860
Who boldly took it?

09:02.210 --> 09:04.240
Minister Song's older daughter.

09:04.240 --> 09:05.030
Really?

09:06.320 --> 09:08.200
This is only between you and me.

09:08.200 --> 09:09.830
Don't tell anyone about it.

09:10.000 --> 09:11.000
You have my word.

09:11.000 --> 09:12.360
I promise not to leak it.

09:12.720 --> 09:13.390
Is it true?

09:13.390 --> 09:14.320
They just hit it off

09:14.320 --> 09:15.440
and clicked right away?

09:15.440 --> 09:16.600
Like two desperate people

09:16.600 --> 09:17.620
who finally found love?

09:17.620 --> 09:18.600
I saw it myself.

09:18.600 --> 09:19.660
I swear it is true.

09:20.670 --> 09:21.840
The Seventh Prince

09:21.870 --> 09:24.440
has put Miss Song's fiancé, General Chu,

09:24.460 --> 09:26.190
behind bars!

09:27.750 --> 09:29.080
My goodness!

09:29.240 --> 09:31.360
Sounds crazier than fictions!

09:31.360 --> 09:33.200
Miss Song has a same hairpin.

09:33.240 --> 09:34.840
That's what she attracted
the God of Death with!

09:34.840 --> 09:36.720
Our newly launched fragrance!

09:36.720 --> 09:38.870
Boys will fall head over heals for you!

09:38.870 --> 09:41.480
The rouge that charmed the Seventh Prince

09:41.480 --> 09:43.190
was bought from me.

09:43.270 --> 09:46.740
[Laiyi House]

09:43.390 --> 09:45.630
This is what Miss Song used to take

09:45.630 --> 09:48.320
the Seventh Prince's
special something away!

09:49.000 --> 09:50.480
What special something?

09:51.440 --> 09:52.910
Are you saying what I'm thinking?

09:52.910 --> 09:54.320
What else could it be?

09:54.320 --> 09:54.840
That special

09:54.840 --> 09:55.500
something!

09:55.790 --> 09:56.750
What is it then?

09:57.390 --> 09:58.960
You're gossiping
outside Miss Song's house.

09:58.960 --> 10:00.670
Don't you have work to do?

10:02.750 --> 10:04.320
Behave like grownups,

10:04.320 --> 10:05.480
you gossipers.

10:05.480 --> 10:06.680
Get back to your work!

10:07.840 --> 10:10.080
You are an actress

10:10.600 --> 10:12.960
in a career upswing.

10:13.440 --> 10:14.960
You merely did a kissing scene

10:14.960 --> 10:16.630
with a co-star.

10:16.630 --> 10:17.960
That's all.

10:17.960 --> 10:19.160
Just a kissing scene.

10:19.320 --> 10:20.600
No big deal, was it?

10:20.630 --> 10:22.480
All actors have done it.

10:22.750 --> 10:23.550
Right?

10:24.270 --> 10:26.200
However, that co-star of yours

10:26.440 --> 10:27.510
is a little...

10:28.150 --> 10:28.960
perverted.

10:30.000 --> 10:31.440
A scumbag, too.

10:31.750 --> 10:32.880
He's a philanderer.

10:33.200 --> 10:34.440
He plays hard to get.

10:34.750 --> 10:35.910
He's a scheming seducer.

10:35.910 --> 10:37.030
A duplicitous man.

10:37.030 --> 10:38.320
A thug in disguise.

10:38.340 --> 10:39.630
A heartless guy.

10:41.120 --> 10:42.120
He's nothing!

10:44.840 --> 10:45.720
Gosh.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.630
I had never ever been

10:47.630 --> 10:49.480
part of such a ridiculous drama.

10:49.650 --> 10:51.790
What a humiliation.

10:53.550 --> 10:55.750
Scriptwriter, can't you be nice to me?

10:56.390 --> 10:58.150
To move the story along doesn't

10:58.550 --> 11:00.690
mean to mistreat the actors, right?

11:02.860 --> 11:05.440
[Erudition and Elegance]

11:04.360 --> 11:05.150
My Lady,

11:05.270 --> 11:06.870
did you really take the God of Death's

11:06.870 --> 11:08.270
special something away?

11:09.200 --> 11:10.000
Good heavens!

11:10.390 --> 11:11.620
My Lady, what got into you?

11:11.620 --> 11:14.480
How could you get involved
with the Seventh Prince?

11:16.690 --> 11:18.740
Don't you find yourselves fickle?

11:20.200 --> 11:21.630
You're scared now.

11:21.650 --> 11:22.480
Should I remind you

11:22.480 --> 11:24.940
who insisted I go to
the palace this morning?

11:25.630 --> 11:26.230
It was her!

11:30.450 --> 11:32.650
[Nan Heng]
[Yingqiu] [Zhixia] [Coachman] [Guards]

11:35.670 --> 11:38.030
Only I have read the script.

11:38.080 --> 11:39.420
In other words,

11:39.450 --> 11:40.670
I'm the only one who knows

11:40.670 --> 11:42.200
what the story is about.

11:43.880 --> 11:46.040
Despite the will of these characters,

11:46.060 --> 11:47.140
they only exist to

11:47.170 --> 11:48.170
assist in forging

11:47.220 --> 11:52.230
[Nan Heng]
[Yingqiu] [Zhixia] [Coachman] [Guards]

11:48.190 --> 11:50.390
a relationship between me and Nan Heng.

11:51.270 --> 11:52.720
They're just pawns.

11:53.920 --> 11:55.160
Now I get it.

11:55.200 --> 11:56.460
Going to the palace...

11:56.560 --> 11:57.990
Falling into the water...

11:57.990 --> 11:58.990
Being saved...

11:59.510 --> 12:00.790
And that

12:01.320 --> 12:02.750
uncontrollable kiss...

12:04.960 --> 12:07.630
The script decides that those must happen.

12:05.270 --> 12:07.920
[Iconic scenes in the script]

12:11.030 --> 12:12.030
So, as the female lead,

12:12.030 --> 12:13.760
I not only have to fight against

12:13.790 --> 12:15.720
the male lead, but also the script?

12:16.140 --> 12:17.670
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

12:19.440 --> 12:20.300
Your Highness,

12:20.550 --> 12:21.670
about what happened in the royal garden,

12:21.670 --> 12:23.270
I've issued a gag order.

12:23.510 --> 12:24.550
Your Highness's reputation

12:24.550 --> 12:25.840
won't be damaged.

12:25.840 --> 12:27.000
If anyone...

12:31.080 --> 12:31.790
Your Highness,

12:31.790 --> 12:33.630
if anyone dares to talk about it again,

12:33.630 --> 12:34.910
I will... I will...

12:34.930 --> 12:35.790
Your Highness,

12:36.080 --> 12:37.440
you must've caught a cold.

12:37.440 --> 12:38.150
Come on.

12:38.910 --> 12:39.320
Here.

12:39.610 --> 12:40.620
Have some soup.

12:43.510 --> 12:44.370
Your Highness,

12:44.910 --> 12:46.120
that was a brilliant

12:46.120 --> 12:47.910
trick of yours.

12:48.150 --> 12:49.840
To enamor Miss Song,

12:50.080 --> 12:51.320
you jumped into

12:51.320 --> 12:52.780
the lake despite the cold.

12:52.840 --> 12:54.480
Then, when everyone was watching,

12:54.480 --> 12:56.630
though humiliated,
you made a huge sacrifice

12:56.630 --> 12:57.960
by sharing a dynamite kiss

12:57.960 --> 13:00.120
with that girl, looking fully

13:00.120 --> 13:01.270
rapt in the moment.

13:01.390 --> 13:02.750
That nearly deceived me.

13:02.750 --> 13:04.270
I didn't mean to do all that.

13:04.270 --> 13:05.550
What I did ashore today

13:06.080 --> 13:07.340
was not within my plan.

13:07.750 --> 13:09.410
Then why did Your Highness...

13:09.550 --> 13:11.010
Song Yimeng must have cast

13:11.510 --> 13:13.240
some sort of an evil spell on me.

13:15.900 --> 13:17.340
Your Highness,

13:17.750 --> 13:18.840
was it you

13:19.640 --> 13:21.510
who saved my life?

13:37.360 --> 13:38.890
That explains everything.

13:39.360 --> 13:41.240
Your Highness are a decent gentleman.

13:41.240 --> 13:43.040
Why would you become completely

13:43.080 --> 13:44.940
different when you saw that girl?

13:45.150 --> 13:46.430
What should we do now?

13:46.720 --> 13:47.580
Your Highness,

13:47.670 --> 13:49.000
shall I invite some masters

13:49.000 --> 13:50.200
over from Ziyun Temple

13:50.200 --> 13:51.400
to perform exorcism?

13:57.650 --> 13:59.200
It's no wonder that Chu Guihong

13:59.200 --> 14:00.860
is still saving himself for her.

14:00.860 --> 14:02.740
She must be a leprechaun.

14:02.790 --> 14:05.390
Chu Guihong hasn't got
married because of her?

14:05.510 --> 14:06.320
Yeah. Just like us,

14:06.320 --> 14:07.520
he's a sad single man.

14:08.840 --> 14:09.650
Your Highness,

14:09.650 --> 14:11.010
I mean...

14:11.030 --> 14:12.970
When Miss Song was six years old,

14:13.080 --> 14:14.240
Lord Qianyu arranged

14:14.240 --> 14:16.240
for her to marry into the Chu family.

14:16.250 --> 14:18.200
It was approved by the Emperor.

14:18.360 --> 14:20.630
Your Highness were in
the cold palace at that time,

14:20.630 --> 14:22.160
so you didn't know about it.

14:22.480 --> 14:23.720
The Chu family has been defending

14:23.720 --> 14:25.550
the borders over all these years.

14:25.550 --> 14:28.150
That arrangement was
thought to have been cancelled.

14:28.150 --> 14:29.670
However, for some reason,

14:29.670 --> 14:31.240
Chu Guihong has never found himself

14:31.240 --> 14:32.870
a wife or a concubine.

14:32.870 --> 14:33.480
It seems like

14:33.480 --> 14:35.010
he's waiting for Miss Song.

14:36.360 --> 14:38.000
I didn't know that before.

14:46.720 --> 14:48.850
Chu Guihong is obsessed with her then.

14:49.710 --> 14:50.960
This can be

14:51.020 --> 14:52.390
my opportunity.

14:53.270 --> 14:54.870
Your Highness are saying...

14:55.670 --> 14:57.200
Withdraw that gag order

14:57.250 --> 14:58.650
about today's incident.

14:58.910 --> 15:01.000
I want the news to reach every corner.

15:02.240 --> 15:03.140
Got it!

15:05.480 --> 15:06.270
Your Highness,

15:06.270 --> 15:07.600
Chancellor Gao is back.

15:12.440 --> 15:13.080
Uncle.

15:16.050 --> 15:17.230
Your Highness.

15:17.440 --> 15:18.770
Forgo the formalities.

15:19.080 --> 15:20.080
Shouldn't you be in Huai region

15:20.080 --> 15:21.550
working on disaster relief now?

15:21.550 --> 15:22.870
Why did you suddenly come back?

15:22.870 --> 15:24.630
I just got some news.

15:23.260 --> 15:27.050
[Chancellor of Great Jing Dynasty]
[Gao Changyin]

15:24.910 --> 15:27.480
The Emperor has
secretly asked the officials

15:27.480 --> 15:29.000
in the Huai Region to
help the Eighteenth Prince

15:29.000 --> 15:31.260
and his supporters
set up soup kitchens.

15:32.000 --> 15:33.660
The Emperor is partial to him.

15:34.550 --> 15:36.000
It's no secret.

15:36.390 --> 15:37.750
No matter how many

15:38.080 --> 15:39.270
battles I've won

15:39.270 --> 15:40.670
or achievements I've made,

15:40.670 --> 15:41.930
he wouldn't notice me.

15:42.660 --> 15:43.690
That piece of news

15:44.390 --> 15:45.590
is no surprise, is it?

15:46.050 --> 15:48.940
Your Highness, do you have a plan?

15:51.240 --> 15:52.770
My troops around the nation

15:53.480 --> 15:55.810
and the 20,000 soldiers of my Xuanjia Army

15:55.840 --> 15:58.840
are no less competent than
Chu Guihong's Qianyu Army.

15:58.870 --> 16:00.270
But the ancestors' guide

16:00.840 --> 16:02.550
on the method of weapon forging

16:02.550 --> 16:04.270
is in Chu Guihong's hands.

16:04.630 --> 16:06.840
If Xuanjia Army has it,

16:07.480 --> 16:09.280
we can better protect ourselves

16:09.480 --> 16:10.270
or even...

16:13.270 --> 16:14.440
start an uprising

16:15.150 --> 16:15.960
with a higher

16:16.270 --> 16:17.630
chance of winning.

16:21.120 --> 16:23.330
Then I'll set up a trap again

16:23.450 --> 16:25.370
to help Your Highness succeed.

16:26.960 --> 16:28.630
Is there good news, Uncle?

16:30.050 --> 16:31.680
In wartime, Chu Guihong

16:31.710 --> 16:32.910
often wrote letters back

16:32.910 --> 16:34.720
to the capital, to his fiancée.

16:35.010 --> 16:36.670
On the eve of Pingrong Battle,

16:36.790 --> 16:38.030
he even had an urgent letter

16:38.030 --> 16:39.490
delivered to the capital.

16:40.210 --> 16:41.570
I think

16:41.800 --> 16:43.160
his fiancée

16:44.020 --> 16:45.970
has the guide now.

16:47.790 --> 16:48.990
You mean Song Yimeng?

16:50.910 --> 16:52.610
You're acquainted with her?

16:55.410 --> 16:57.270
She's more than an acquaintance.

16:58.610 --> 17:01.560
Her father is the Minister of War.

17:02.510 --> 17:05.240
I once planned to bond with
Song Yude through her.

17:06.400 --> 17:07.750
Little did I expect

17:08.550 --> 17:10.280
that she'd bring me surprises.

17:10.880 --> 17:12.200
Move the boxes inwards!

17:10.970 --> 17:15.510
[Song Residence]

17:12.200 --> 17:13.000
That's right!

17:13.550 --> 17:14.589
Keep up, guys!

17:14.640 --> 17:15.440
Hurry!

17:15.690 --> 17:17.160
Yes, bring the cases in.

17:18.270 --> 17:19.760
Three chests of art works.

17:19.829 --> 17:21.230
Three chests of jewelry.

17:21.440 --> 17:22.829
500 taels of gold.

17:21.890 --> 17:23.010
[Laiyi House]

17:22.880 --> 17:25.119
-A pair of jade coral.
-So much money!

17:25.240 --> 17:26.720
A jade decoration.

17:26.829 --> 17:28.830
-Two boxes of pearls.
-So many precious items!

17:27.020 --> 17:34.220
[Laiyi House]

17:28.950 --> 17:30.900
A night illuminating pearl.

17:31.030 --> 17:32.030
A jade pendant.

17:32.030 --> 17:33.030
Treasures!

17:34.510 --> 17:35.410
Miss Song,

17:35.480 --> 17:37.510
you must've been frightened yesterday.

17:37.510 --> 17:39.160
His Highness would like you

17:39.200 --> 17:40.790
to accept these humble gifts

17:40.790 --> 17:41.980
and meet with him.

17:43.700 --> 17:45.480
Are these all from Nan Heng?

17:46.450 --> 17:47.680
I'm sorry.

17:48.110 --> 17:49.510
I'm not a good fit for him.

17:50.780 --> 17:51.900
Off you go!

18:00.680 --> 18:01.540
Your Highness,

18:01.920 --> 18:03.000
Miss Song declined the gifts

18:03.000 --> 18:04.060
or to meet with you.

18:04.070 --> 18:05.070
What should we do?

18:05.960 --> 18:07.420
She's playing hard to get.

18:07.440 --> 18:08.640
What a prude.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.440
She can't stop me

18:11.030 --> 18:12.960
from doing what I want.

18:15.760 --> 18:17.170
[Day 1]

18:17.640 --> 18:18.440
This one looks nice.

18:18.440 --> 18:19.070
It seems good.

18:19.070 --> 18:19.880
Quite nice.

18:21.480 --> 18:22.540
This one is pretty.

18:24.750 --> 18:25.550
Sir,

18:25.640 --> 18:27.070
what are you doing?

18:38.790 --> 18:39.400
Nan Heng?

18:39.400 --> 18:40.110
Hurry up.

18:40.060 --> 18:41.820
♪ Candied haws are wonderful ♪

18:40.110 --> 18:41.070
Let's go.

18:42.400 --> 18:44.720
♪ Candied haws, we're proud of you ♪

18:45.410 --> 18:47.390
♪ Candied haws are wonderful ♪

18:46.140 --> 18:47.640
[Day 2]

18:47.740 --> 18:50.000
♪ Candied haws, we're proud of you ♪

18:47.750 --> 18:48.680
Thank you, sir.

18:48.680 --> 18:49.110
No problem.

18:49.110 --> 18:50.720
Candied haws on a stick!

18:51.280 --> 18:52.920
♪ They say the Seventh Prince
is a god in the story ♪

18:51.640 --> 18:53.200
Candied haws on a stick!

18:53.980 --> 18:55.770
♪ They say the Seventh Prince
is already yours ♪

18:56.580 --> 18:58.590
♪ Seventh Prince,
how much do you love me? ♪

18:59.500 --> 19:01.350
♪ They say the Seventh Prince
is already yours ♪

19:12.830 --> 19:13.640
What?

19:17.120 --> 19:19.290
Why is he everywhere?

19:20.440 --> 19:22.660
I won't eat candied haws again.

19:22.690 --> 19:24.140
I won't!

19:24.860 --> 19:26.250
[Day 3]

19:27.640 --> 19:29.270
The Seventh Prince
wrote a new poem again.

19:29.270 --> 19:30.530
Have you memorized it?

19:30.640 --> 19:32.070
A new poem again?

19:32.070 --> 19:33.080
Yes.

19:33.160 --> 19:33.920
Have you heard?

19:33.920 --> 19:35.330
The Seventh Prince's Xuanjia Army makes

19:35.330 --> 19:36.240
candied haws every day.

19:36.240 --> 19:38.070
I'm not hearing any of that.

19:36.730 --> 19:38.320
♪ Candied haws are wonderful ♪

19:38.310 --> 19:39.340
I'm not hearing anything.

19:38.860 --> 19:41.250
♪ Candied haws, we're proud of you ♪

19:39.400 --> 19:40.510
It can't bother me.

19:40.590 --> 19:41.790
I'm not hearing anything.

19:41.790 --> 19:42.680
Seventh Prince!

19:41.980 --> 19:43.760
♪ Candied haws are wonderful ♪

19:43.400 --> 19:44.350
Seventh Prince!

19:44.370 --> 19:46.480
♪ Candied haws, we're proud of you ♪

19:44.920 --> 19:45.880
Seventh Prince!

19:46.310 --> 19:46.920
Seventh Prince!

19:46.920 --> 19:47.750
Little birdie,

19:47.640 --> 19:49.530
♪ They say the Seventh Prince
is a god in the story ♪

19:47.750 --> 19:49.240
what's wrong with you?

19:49.310 --> 19:50.270
Seventh Prince!

19:50.380 --> 19:52.340
♪ They say the Seventh Prince
is already yours ♪

19:52.160 --> 19:53.160
God,

19:53.240 --> 19:55.090
♪ Seventh Prince,
how much do you love me? ♪

19:53.830 --> 19:55.820
I don't want to be with the male lead.

19:55.820 --> 19:57.750
♪ Here I present you
the yummy candied haws! ♪

19:55.830 --> 19:57.400
Is it too much to ask?

20:02.070 --> 20:02.880
Spill it.

20:03.240 --> 20:05.040
What do you want me to do now, Mom?

20:06.240 --> 20:08.510
Aren't you ashamed to ask that?

20:08.830 --> 20:09.640
Song Yimeng

20:09.640 --> 20:11.830
had the guts to entice the God of Death.

20:12.070 --> 20:12.960
What did I

20:13.240 --> 20:14.460
tell you before the party?

20:14.460 --> 20:17.040
I asked you to get
the Eighteenth Prince's attention.

20:17.040 --> 20:19.790
The entire country sees him
as an auspicious symbol.

20:19.790 --> 20:21.830
The Emperor values him
as the heir to the throne.

20:21.830 --> 20:23.270
Can you possibly find

20:23.270 --> 20:24.730
a better husband than him?

20:29.200 --> 20:30.430
I'm talking to you.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.110
I have

20:32.130 --> 20:34.550
figured out where the Eighteenth Prince

20:34.550 --> 20:36.130
will be in the coming days.

20:36.240 --> 20:38.000
Why don't you doll up, go out,

20:38.020 --> 20:39.590
and pretend to run into him?

20:41.190 --> 20:42.620
Don't bother.

20:43.000 --> 20:44.000
I've made up my mind.

20:44.000 --> 20:44.880
I will never

20:44.900 --> 20:45.780
get married.

20:47.920 --> 20:49.090
Song Yiting,

20:49.110 --> 20:50.250
you're not getting any younger.

20:50.250 --> 20:51.820
You think I can provide for you forever?

20:51.820 --> 20:52.860
Listen up,

20:52.890 --> 20:54.530
you must take action now

20:54.550 --> 20:55.520
before all

20:55.550 --> 20:57.000
the eligible bachelors are taken.

20:57.000 --> 20:57.720
You'll regret it

20:57.720 --> 20:59.320
when everything's too late!

20:59.680 --> 21:00.480
What?

21:04.070 --> 21:05.240
Shannai, Yinzhu,

21:05.240 --> 21:05.830
let's go.

21:06.000 --> 21:06.440
Yes.

21:06.440 --> 21:07.410
Song Yiting!

21:12.430 --> 21:14.110
What is this?

21:14.030 --> 21:15.910
[Closing the doors, I receive no guests]
[Looking at the sky, I lean by
the bamboo with pride]

21:17.350 --> 21:18.880
I can't write poems,

21:18.900 --> 21:20.570
but I can tame my husband.

21:23.490 --> 21:31.210
[Song Residence]

21:34.010 --> 21:35.220
Your Highness,

21:35.510 --> 21:37.590
Miss Song really is sick.

21:38.590 --> 21:40.350
This is His Highness's tenth visit.

21:40.350 --> 21:42.160
Miss Song has been sick in seven of them.

21:42.160 --> 21:43.720
That day, in the royal garden,

21:43.720 --> 21:44.550
I didn't see

21:44.550 --> 21:46.110
Miss Song was so delicate.

21:48.350 --> 21:51.480
She caught a cold today.

21:51.480 --> 21:52.810
The weather's been bad.

21:54.680 --> 21:55.480
Bring it up.

22:01.550 --> 22:03.240
Whether it's a cold or diarrhea,

22:03.240 --> 22:04.480
minor injuries

22:04.720 --> 22:06.160
or deficiency of Qi and blood,

22:06.160 --> 22:07.830
or a fatal disease,

22:08.000 --> 22:10.460
I've prepared the medicines for all of them.

22:10.890 --> 22:12.090
What else can you say?

22:12.550 --> 22:13.820
Let me tell you.

22:13.960 --> 22:16.270
The rumor about what happened
in the royal garden has gone viral.

22:16.270 --> 22:18.240
Your young mistress refused to meet with us.

22:18.240 --> 22:18.920
She just doesn't want to

22:18.920 --> 22:21.320
be responsible for His Highness, does she?

22:23.330 --> 22:24.670
Did he really say that?

22:25.550 --> 22:27.110
The Seventh Prince also said,

22:27.110 --> 22:27.830
"Today,

22:27.830 --> 22:29.790
I will see her no matter what.

22:29.790 --> 22:30.880
Tell her to give up her struggle

22:30.880 --> 22:31.720
and stop resisting.

22:31.720 --> 22:32.320
Otherwise,

22:32.320 --> 22:34.030
she'll never be able to clear her name

22:34.030 --> 22:36.440
for tarnishing the reputation of a good prince."

22:36.440 --> 22:38.160
Isn't that blackmailing?

22:38.640 --> 22:40.030
I've never seen

22:40.050 --> 22:41.680
such a shameless person.

22:41.750 --> 22:42.750
If he were put in modern times,

22:42.750 --> 22:43.240
he would be really good at

22:43.240 --> 22:44.720
staging a showmance.

22:44.880 --> 22:48.200
[Salted Fish Escape Plan]

22:48.360 --> 22:49.560
That's odd.

22:49.790 --> 22:51.030
There's no plot

22:51.030 --> 22:53.160
of his passionately pursuing me here.

22:54.550 --> 22:56.760
Is it the script playing tricks again—

22:56.830 --> 22:58.480
forcing a romantic subplot

22:58.590 --> 22:59.960
between the leads?

23:01.480 --> 23:02.270
Miss.

23:02.830 --> 23:03.640
Miss.

23:04.720 --> 23:05.510
Miss.

23:05.590 --> 23:06.440
Bad news.

23:06.680 --> 23:08.880
The Seventh Prince and his men broke in.

23:09.760 --> 23:11.080
You two, cover for me.

23:11.100 --> 23:11.750
I'm outta here.

23:11.750 --> 23:12.440
Miss,

23:12.440 --> 23:13.770
Master wants to see you.

23:13.920 --> 23:15.780
The Seventh Prince is also there.

23:23.240 --> 23:25.640
Mr. Song, have you recovered from your cold?

23:25.640 --> 23:26.900
Yes, I just got over it.

23:31.880 --> 23:33.880
White tea is brewed with snow water,

23:33.920 --> 23:36.520
mixed with Evodia fruit and dried tangerine peel.

23:36.520 --> 23:38.250
You have a good taste, Mr. Song.

23:40.000 --> 23:41.270
The water was from the jar of snow

23:41.270 --> 23:42.640
I collected in the plum woods outside the city

23:42.640 --> 23:44.880
the year it snowed heavily.

23:44.880 --> 23:46.510
I knew Your Highness were coming today,

23:46.510 --> 23:48.640
so I asked someone to
take the jar out from underground.

23:48.640 --> 23:49.500
Your Highness,

23:49.750 --> 23:51.110
try this tea.

23:51.830 --> 23:54.690
It's ambrosia that has been
sealed for three years.

24:07.280 --> 24:08.540
It is indeed ambrosia.

24:10.250 --> 24:13.030
Everyone says that the Seventh Prince
has great military merits

24:13.030 --> 24:14.510
and uncommon perspectives.

24:14.510 --> 24:17.550
I didn't expect you also excel in

24:17.550 --> 24:19.350
these refined pastimes of winter.

24:19.350 --> 24:20.880
My daughter is different.

24:20.900 --> 24:22.270
All she knows is fooling around all day.

24:22.270 --> 24:23.550
She never behaves properly.

24:23.550 --> 24:25.440
I put well water and water from the sky

24:25.440 --> 24:26.960
in front of her at the same time,

24:26.960 --> 24:29.090
and she couldn't tell the difference!

24:29.680 --> 24:32.030
It seems that Your Highness and my daughter

24:32.030 --> 24:34.550
are like clouds and mud.

24:36.750 --> 24:38.270
I can't agree with that, Mr. Song.

24:38.270 --> 24:40.350
I've seen many beautiful girls,

24:40.790 --> 24:41.720
but I'm only into

24:41.720 --> 24:44.310
Miss Song's natural

24:44.310 --> 24:46.160
and uncarved personality.

24:47.270 --> 24:48.870
How can a favored man like you

24:48.920 --> 24:52.110
be mentioned in the same breath as
an ordinary woman like my daughter?

24:52.110 --> 24:55.160
You will achieve great things in the future,

24:55.510 --> 24:56.830
but my family...

24:57.070 --> 24:59.310
I'm not young anymore.

24:59.310 --> 25:00.170
I'm afraid

25:00.310 --> 25:03.000
that when I'm six feet under,

25:04.000 --> 25:06.680
our family will have nothing to help you.

25:08.680 --> 25:10.000
There are things,

25:10.790 --> 25:11.750
Your Highness,

25:12.350 --> 25:14.750
that you have to have other plans with.

25:17.270 --> 25:18.350
Miss Song and I

25:18.510 --> 25:19.880
love each other.

25:20.200 --> 25:21.880
Why did you talk about helping me?

25:21.880 --> 25:22.680
However,

25:22.720 --> 25:24.590
I deeply appreciate your love for your daughter.

25:24.590 --> 25:25.720
So, rest assured.

25:25.960 --> 25:27.160
As long as you are willing to

25:27.160 --> 25:28.960
leave your daughter in my care,

25:29.000 --> 25:30.510
when you pass away,

25:30.510 --> 25:32.750
I will take care of the Song family.

25:33.000 --> 25:33.790
Isn't this

25:33.920 --> 25:35.510
a win-win situation?

25:35.960 --> 25:37.550
You... Well…

25:37.550 --> 25:38.200
Father.

25:39.160 --> 25:40.070
Your Highness.

25:40.070 --> 25:40.790
Yimeng.

25:41.270 --> 25:42.640
Come, sit down.

25:49.640 --> 25:50.970
Miss Song, has your cold

25:52.030 --> 25:53.240
recovered, too?

25:58.000 --> 25:59.160
Your Highness,

25:59.750 --> 26:01.310
the cold did get better,

26:01.310 --> 26:02.970
but I'm left with this ailment

26:02.990 --> 26:04.590
of coughing.

26:04.920 --> 26:06.200
That's why I dare not

26:06.590 --> 26:08.160
go out recently.

26:11.800 --> 26:12.870
What's going on?

26:13.080 --> 26:14.110
Didn't the script say

26:14.110 --> 26:15.480
they never got along?

26:15.790 --> 26:17.850
Why did he invite Nan Heng to sit here?

26:19.440 --> 26:20.240
Yimeng,

26:21.000 --> 26:22.240
didn't you say

26:22.270 --> 26:25.440
there was a misunderstanding
between you two in the royal garden?

26:25.440 --> 26:27.000
I invited His Highness here today

26:27.000 --> 26:29.030
so that you can explain everything

26:29.180 --> 26:30.380
with him face to face.

26:36.960 --> 26:38.820
I can't agree with that, Mr. Song.

26:38.920 --> 26:40.890
That day, the shore was crowded
with onlookers.

26:40.890 --> 26:42.310
Miss Song and I

26:42.350 --> 26:43.680
love each other.

26:44.270 --> 26:46.000
There's no misunderstanding.

26:46.350 --> 26:48.510
Your Highness, this isn't something
to say without thinking.

26:48.510 --> 26:49.680
My daughter

26:49.720 --> 26:51.590
has been engaged to Chu since childhood.

26:51.590 --> 26:53.200
She has always abided by the rules.

26:53.200 --> 26:54.590
The rules are rigid,

26:55.160 --> 26:56.420
but people are alive and should be flexible.

26:56.420 --> 26:57.550
But we can't let

26:57.580 --> 26:59.730
the living people be drowned

26:59.790 --> 27:01.220
by other people's slander.

27:01.220 --> 27:02.500
So,

27:02.550 --> 27:03.750
my daughter

27:03.930 --> 27:05.550
dare not have any feelings

27:05.550 --> 27:06.920
toward Your Highness.

27:07.310 --> 27:08.270
So, Your Highness,

27:08.270 --> 27:10.240
please don't take it the wrong way.

27:10.880 --> 27:11.720
Come on.

27:11.920 --> 27:13.170
Have some tea.

27:13.400 --> 27:14.640
Have some tea.

27:16.480 --> 27:18.160
So, Mr. Song, do you mean

27:21.470 --> 27:23.270
I think too much?

27:27.900 --> 27:28.700
Yimeng,

27:30.160 --> 27:32.420
who is right between me and His Highness?

27:32.590 --> 27:33.400
Miss Song,

27:34.310 --> 27:35.110
tell us.

27:37.160 --> 27:39.510
This is an EQ question.

27:47.760 --> 27:48.560
Miss Song.

27:49.790 --> 27:50.590
That day,

27:51.260 --> 27:52.990
I saved you from the lake.

27:53.680 --> 27:54.750
But if you don't remember

27:54.750 --> 27:56.350
what happened on the shore,

27:57.160 --> 27:58.620
I don't mind describing it

27:58.640 --> 28:00.550
for Mr. Song.

28:09.020 --> 28:11.330
Your Highness is wise.

28:11.770 --> 28:13.540
Thank you for saving me

28:13.790 --> 28:15.390
in the loyal garden that day.

28:15.990 --> 28:18.510
It's a blessing for me.

28:21.520 --> 28:22.990
Your Highness,

28:23.270 --> 28:25.460
what you have done for me these days,

28:25.490 --> 28:27.740
I'm really grateful.

28:28.070 --> 28:29.930
I'll never forget your kindness.

28:34.890 --> 28:36.430
It's just that…

28:37.960 --> 28:39.510
love

28:39.540 --> 28:41.210
can't be forced.

28:42.440 --> 28:44.630
Just take what I did that day as

28:45.400 --> 28:46.680
an act of drunken recklessness.

28:46.680 --> 28:47.960
My mind was fogged.

28:48.080 --> 28:49.200
Just consider it

28:49.240 --> 28:52.510
a mistake that most women would make.

28:52.720 --> 28:54.240
But I also have something

28:54.240 --> 28:55.720
to ask you.

28:56.310 --> 28:58.070
You're obviously skilled in martial arts

28:58.070 --> 28:59.350
and invincible,

28:59.680 --> 29:01.830
but why did you let me

29:01.830 --> 29:03.680
molest you in public?

29:03.830 --> 29:04.750
You didn't take the initiative,

29:04.750 --> 29:05.750
but you didn't refuse

29:05.750 --> 29:07.240
or take responsibility, either.

29:07.240 --> 29:08.070
Is it that

29:08.550 --> 29:10.030
you want to make

29:10.130 --> 29:13.310
the mistake that every man would make?

29:14.720 --> 29:17.750
Why does Yimeng behave like a different person?

29:18.760 --> 29:20.090
So,

29:20.120 --> 29:22.260
it takes two to tangle.

29:22.730 --> 29:23.860
I

29:23.880 --> 29:25.590
might be a player,

29:25.640 --> 29:27.000
but Your Highness,

29:27.270 --> 29:29.590
you seem to be one, too.

29:29.720 --> 29:30.790
But don't worry.

29:30.830 --> 29:32.280
I'm not the kind of woman

29:32.310 --> 29:33.640
who cries and threatens to hang herself

29:33.640 --> 29:35.900
to force the man to take responsibility.

29:36.690 --> 29:38.200
When the fleeting passion

29:38.350 --> 29:39.200
fades,

29:39.390 --> 29:40.990
let it fade.

29:41.200 --> 29:42.350
From now on,

29:42.350 --> 29:44.310
let's just

29:44.310 --> 29:45.510
go our separate ways.

29:45.790 --> 29:47.190
How is it, Your Highness?

29:50.270 --> 29:51.110
This should break

29:51.110 --> 29:53.240
the romantic subplot with him, right?

30:00.270 --> 30:02.000
Don't get drunk again.

30:02.000 --> 30:02.920
Do you hear me?

30:05.350 --> 30:06.210
Your Highness.

30:06.440 --> 30:08.270
The misunderstanding has been cleared up.

30:08.270 --> 30:09.070
Here.

30:09.310 --> 30:10.400
Have some tea.

30:10.550 --> 30:11.640
Have some tea.

30:11.640 --> 30:12.480
Mr. Song,

30:13.310 --> 30:14.540
since it's a misunderstanding,

30:14.540 --> 30:16.340
it's great that it's solved now.

30:18.200 --> 30:19.530
I won't bother you then.

30:22.310 --> 30:23.070
Miss Song,

30:24.090 --> 30:25.560
can you see me out?

30:26.160 --> 30:28.300
No, this is not appropriate, Your Highness.

30:28.300 --> 30:29.930
We have just made this clear.

30:30.110 --> 30:31.680
Others would gossip again.

30:33.620 --> 30:34.410
Yimeng,

30:34.950 --> 30:36.750
all who come are treated as guests.

30:36.750 --> 30:38.840
His Highness is so very understanding.

30:38.840 --> 30:40.190
Besides,

30:40.510 --> 30:41.870
refined people like us

30:42.400 --> 30:43.640
can't be rude.

30:53.330 --> 30:54.710
Please, Your Highness.

30:58.480 --> 30:59.340
Your Highness,

30:59.480 --> 31:01.510
Miss Song doesn't seem to play hard to get.

31:01.510 --> 31:02.460
She really doesn't like you.

31:02.460 --> 31:03.250
Shut up.

31:21.550 --> 31:24.310
What a waste of my delicacies.

31:30.920 --> 31:31.680
Fugui.

31:32.590 --> 31:34.160
Go ahead and watch for me.

31:34.240 --> 31:35.270
I have something

31:35.310 --> 31:36.710
to tell Miss Song.

31:36.790 --> 31:38.200
I don't think it's necessary.

31:38.200 --> 31:39.070
We've said

31:39.110 --> 31:41.040
all that we should say, haven't we?

32:09.310 --> 32:10.100
You...

32:10.690 --> 32:11.620
What do you want?

32:15.490 --> 32:16.610
I just want to see

32:16.630 --> 32:17.970
what will happen.

32:19.680 --> 32:20.480
That day,

32:21.160 --> 32:22.580
you controlled me.

32:32.510 --> 32:33.310
Am I right?

32:33.830 --> 32:34.550
I...

32:34.550 --> 32:35.690
You were under…

32:36.320 --> 32:37.330
control, too?

32:37.750 --> 32:38.550
"Too"?

32:40.140 --> 32:42.110
Stop pretending.

32:42.480 --> 32:43.270
Say it.

32:44.410 --> 32:46.210
You played tricks to control me.

32:46.240 --> 32:47.550
What is your agenda?

32:48.240 --> 32:49.030
I...

32:49.600 --> 32:52.200
I don't understand what you're talking about.

32:56.960 --> 32:58.440
I saved you when you
fell into the water that day.

32:58.440 --> 32:59.900
You didn't appreciate it.

33:00.920 --> 33:03.680
But then you threw yourself
into my arms on the shore.

33:03.680 --> 33:05.270
And now "misunderstanding" is your excuse

33:05.270 --> 33:06.400
for turning me down?

33:08.880 --> 33:09.680
What?

33:10.200 --> 33:11.880
Do I look like a fool?

33:14.640 --> 33:16.000
No, Your Highness.

33:16.020 --> 33:18.020
This really is a misunderstanding.

33:18.110 --> 33:18.960
It's true.

33:20.620 --> 33:21.660
Your Highness!

33:25.440 --> 33:28.260
This is where the Minister of War…

33:28.880 --> 33:29.680
Say it!

33:31.310 --> 33:32.620
How can I explain it?

33:32.720 --> 33:33.750
If I tell him it's the script's setting

33:33.750 --> 33:34.960
and the romantic subplot between the leads

33:34.960 --> 33:36.200
or it's the iconic scene mechanism,

33:36.200 --> 33:37.830
he'll stab me now.

33:39.830 --> 33:40.640
Say it!

33:43.750 --> 33:44.550
Okay.

33:44.850 --> 33:46.450
Okay, I will, Your Highness.

33:46.590 --> 33:48.170
Calm down. Calm down.

33:48.310 --> 33:49.770
I'll tell you everything.

33:49.880 --> 33:51.030
Actually...

33:51.490 --> 33:53.240
Actually it's all because of...

33:53.240 --> 33:54.030
well,

33:55.000 --> 33:56.060
Mr. Screenwriter.

33:58.790 --> 33:59.790
Mister…

34:00.240 --> 34:01.100
Screenwriter?

34:04.070 --> 34:05.130
Yes.

34:05.640 --> 34:06.970
It's Mr. Screenwriter.

34:07.240 --> 34:08.530
This is

34:08.670 --> 34:10.860
a mysterious power from the ancient east.

34:10.860 --> 34:12.110
He knows everything

34:12.150 --> 34:13.360
and can control

34:13.360 --> 34:15.560
everyone's life, death, pain, and joy.

34:17.610 --> 34:19.360
If you

34:19.469 --> 34:21.260
really can't understand,

34:21.280 --> 34:23.150
you can take him

34:23.230 --> 34:24.190
as Bodhisattva,

34:24.280 --> 34:25.150
God of Earth,

34:25.280 --> 34:26.980
Buddha, or any other god.

34:27.070 --> 34:27.840
The point is

34:27.840 --> 34:29.320
he sent me many dreams.

34:29.340 --> 34:30.670
They were all about you.

34:30.670 --> 34:31.760
So, Your Highness,

34:31.790 --> 34:33.270
I came to this world

34:33.320 --> 34:34.880
to help you succeed.

34:34.880 --> 34:36.139
We are on the same side.

34:36.760 --> 34:37.469
God?

34:39.710 --> 34:40.639
Sent you dreams?

34:44.960 --> 34:45.760
Keep lying.

34:46.440 --> 34:47.900
I'm not making up stories.

34:49.510 --> 34:50.630
When you were nine,

34:50.630 --> 34:52.710
did the emperor leave you in the cold palace or not?

34:52.710 --> 34:53.840
You had chilblains on your hands and feet,

34:53.840 --> 34:54.710
but he turned a blind eye.

34:54.710 --> 34:55.480
At the age of ten,

34:55.480 --> 34:56.550
you fell victim to a plot

34:56.550 --> 34:57.800
while training in martial arts.

34:57.800 --> 34:58.600
Your right arm

34:58.670 --> 34:59.800
was fractured in three places

34:59.800 --> 35:00.920
and nearly ended up disabled.

35:00.920 --> 35:02.150
Am I right,

35:07.840 --> 35:08.630
Okay.

35:08.940 --> 35:10.960
When you were 12,
there was a drought in the capital.

35:10.960 --> 35:12.070
Then, you were in the cold palace,

35:12.070 --> 35:13.710
you had absolutely nothing to eat.

35:13.710 --> 35:14.280
At that critical moment,

35:14.280 --> 35:17.140
wasn't it the grass in the yard
that saved your life?

35:19.760 --> 35:20.530
Fine.

35:21.040 --> 35:22.710
Those are just anecdotal rumors

35:22.710 --> 35:23.710
about the palace.

35:24.530 --> 35:26.290
Ask any of the old eunuchs

35:26.510 --> 35:27.710
and they'll tell you.

35:30.400 --> 35:31.190
Fine.

35:32.070 --> 35:34.220
If you don't believe any of those,

35:36.050 --> 35:39.050
what about what happened between
you and Chu Guihong?

35:41.400 --> 35:42.510
You two

35:42.630 --> 35:44.360
had been best friends since childhood.

35:42.950 --> 35:44.110
[Chu Guihong (as a child)]

35:44.610 --> 35:45.890
[Nan Heng (as a child)]

35:45.190 --> 35:47.650
But because of the death of the late Empress,

35:48.070 --> 35:49.760
you two fell apart

35:49.760 --> 35:51.070
and became enemies.

35:51.800 --> 35:52.840
I know all of it.

35:52.840 --> 35:54.590
Really, I know everything.

35:55.070 --> 35:56.190
I also know

35:56.550 --> 35:58.120
you've been through a lot,

35:58.440 --> 36:00.220
but no matter how hard you try,

36:00.340 --> 36:02.200
the world only sees you as God of Death

36:02.200 --> 36:03.320
and someone evil.

36:03.350 --> 36:04.310
Even His Majesty

36:04.330 --> 36:06.030
has never even spared you a proper glance,

36:06.030 --> 36:06.960
because all he sees is

36:06.960 --> 36:08.320
that Eighteenth Prince, Nan Rui.

36:08.320 --> 36:09.030
That's why you're feeling wronged.

36:09.030 --> 36:09.960
That's why you want to revolt.

36:09.960 --> 36:10.670
That's why you want to take back

36:10.670 --> 36:11.960
everything that should've been yours
in the first place!

36:11.960 --> 36:13.150
Am I right,

36:13.190 --> 36:14.110
Your Highness?

36:28.560 --> 36:30.220
I really underestimated you.

36:34.160 --> 36:36.100
Who told you these things?

36:37.040 --> 36:38.180
Chu Guihong,

36:38.440 --> 36:39.280
Song Yude,

36:40.190 --> 36:41.660
or someone else?

36:41.760 --> 36:42.550
Wait, bro.

36:42.630 --> 36:44.070
You don't believe in anything.

36:44.070 --> 36:45.320
You're just being a troll now, huh?

36:45.320 --> 36:46.190
What exactly do you want to hear?

36:46.190 --> 36:47.590
What on earth do you want?

36:48.370 --> 36:49.680
What does he want?

36:50.790 --> 36:54.650
[A Dream of Qingning, Scene 29, Episode 38]

36:53.630 --> 36:55.150
What exactly do you want?

36:57.540 --> 36:58.680
Within three days,

37:00.290 --> 37:02.650
I want you to hand in all the letters

37:02.710 --> 37:04.190
between Song Yimeng

37:04.530 --> 37:05.990
and Chu Guihong.

37:07.120 --> 37:08.510
Otherwise…

37:08.820 --> 37:09.880
Letters?

37:11.880 --> 37:13.740
What exactly are you looking for?

37:14.740 --> 37:16.400
The method of weapon forging.

37:16.940 --> 37:18.600
The method of weapon forging.

37:21.590 --> 37:23.250
The method of weapon forging.

37:28.800 --> 37:30.480
Am I right, Your Highness?

37:31.820 --> 37:33.140
Now, you should

37:33.310 --> 37:35.020
trust me?

37:35.350 --> 37:37.860
Miss Song, do you know what you're talking about?

37:37.860 --> 37:40.060
Of course I know what I'm talking about.

37:40.370 --> 37:42.140
The method of weapon forging

37:42.580 --> 37:44.060
of the Qianyu Army.

37:45.580 --> 37:46.610
Your Highness.

37:47.330 --> 37:49.090
If you want to find it,

37:49.400 --> 37:50.840
I can help you get it.

37:51.730 --> 37:52.480
Really.

37:56.000 --> 37:57.020
Nan Heng.

37:57.920 --> 37:59.920
It's better to have one more ally than enemy.

37:59.920 --> 38:01.670
I can really help you get it.

38:02.070 --> 38:02.880
Can...

38:03.550 --> 38:04.360
Can...

38:04.400 --> 38:06.440
Can you let me go first?

38:06.560 --> 38:07.770
Please.

38:18.360 --> 38:19.150
Fine.

38:25.190 --> 38:26.320
What happened today

38:27.020 --> 38:28.790
is a secret between you and me.

38:31.250 --> 38:32.660
From now on,

38:33.510 --> 38:35.000
you and I are allies.

38:35.850 --> 38:37.740
Miss Song, I'll count on you

38:39.320 --> 38:40.650
to help me in the future.

38:44.390 --> 38:45.480
Don't worry, Your Highness.

38:45.480 --> 38:47.240
I will. I will.

38:47.420 --> 38:48.380
For sure.

39:05.060 --> 39:07.360
[Song Residence]

39:07.870 --> 39:09.670
The method of weapon forging.

39:10.600 --> 39:12.260
The method of weapon forging.

39:13.690 --> 39:15.350
The method of weapon forging.

39:15.810 --> 39:17.740
Where can I find the method of weapon forging?

39:17.740 --> 39:19.440
It's clearly written in the script

39:19.440 --> 39:21.420
that it's in the letters Chu Guihong
wrote to me.

39:21.420 --> 39:23.540
But the rich family has so big a mansion.

39:23.540 --> 39:25.790
It will take me forever to find it!

39:33.510 --> 39:35.070
[Dear Yimeng, Heyuan people frequently cause trouble at the border these days]

39:41.000 --> 39:42.000
Chu Guihong

39:42.000 --> 39:43.110
is not a general

39:43.110 --> 39:44.550
but a writer, isn't he?

39:44.800 --> 39:46.400
He wrote so much!

39:53.560 --> 39:56.060
[The Method of Weapon Forging]

39:56.840 --> 39:58.360
I found it!

40:13.190 --> 40:14.800
Come on, Mr. Screenwriter.

40:14.910 --> 40:16.280
If you can't write,

40:16.280 --> 40:17.550
you can just quit.

40:17.760 --> 40:19.640
Now, you're killing me!

40:19.960 --> 40:22.190
Miss, what happened?

40:22.630 --> 40:23.440
Nothing.

40:23.800 --> 40:24.590
You guys…

40:25.760 --> 40:27.280
go get me a grave plot.

40:27.880 --> 40:29.780
Instead of having all my limbs cut off,

40:29.780 --> 40:31.630
I'd rather kill myself.

40:44.150 --> 40:45.010
Your Highness.

40:45.440 --> 40:46.500
We've got the news.

40:46.510 --> 40:47.320
Ten years ago,

40:47.440 --> 40:49.300
when Chu Guihong went to the border
on a military expedition,

40:49.300 --> 40:51.550
it was Miss Song who saw him off in person.

40:51.550 --> 40:53.690
Since then, they've corresponded
with each other every month.

40:53.690 --> 40:54.630
Before, in the capital,

40:54.630 --> 40:55.480
Miss Song

40:55.480 --> 40:56.360
lived in seclusion.

40:56.360 --> 40:57.230
She didn't have many friends.

40:57.230 --> 40:59.000
And she didn't get along with her sister.

40:59.000 --> 41:00.260
Say something useful.

41:01.680 --> 41:02.760
Miss Song

41:02.760 --> 41:04.220
rarely came to the palace.

41:04.710 --> 41:05.880
And we didn't find

41:05.880 --> 41:08.630
she's ever paid any attention to your news.

41:09.070 --> 41:10.030
What she said today

41:10.030 --> 41:11.030
is probably true.

41:12.320 --> 41:13.760
I don't buy into

41:14.670 --> 41:16.270
all the supernatural stuff,

41:17.070 --> 41:19.590
but a young lady who lives in seclusion

41:20.630 --> 41:22.320
knows so much about me.

41:23.370 --> 41:25.830
She even knows about my great cause.

41:27.190 --> 41:28.510
Who is she loyal to?

41:28.960 --> 41:29.760
Nan Rui

41:30.710 --> 41:31.630
or His Majesty?

41:35.110 --> 41:36.710
No matter who she is loyal to,

41:37.280 --> 41:38.280
that mouth of hers

41:39.070 --> 41:40.670
is better to be shut.
